{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44972","headline":"奉酬颜使君真卿王员外圆宿寺兼送员外使回 · 皎然","name":"奉酬颜使君真卿王员外圆宿寺兼送员外使回","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲁公邀省客，贫寺人过少。\n锦帐惟野花，竹屏有窗筱。\n朝行石色净，夜听泉声小。\n释事情已高，依禅境无扰。\n超遥长路首，怅望空林杪。\n离思从此生，还将此心了。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}